//! Parameter tree schema, values, snapshot (.snap) load/save and routing tables.
//!
//! This crate holds the complete WING parameter tree (WING-Edit 3.3.4: 43,008 nodes, 36,499
//! parameters) as a flat, index-addressed store:
//!
//! - [`Schema`]: static metadata decoded from `src/schema.bin` (generated by
//!   `tools/schema-extract/gen_model.py` from `data/schema/wing-tree.json` plus the firmware
//!   3.0.6 factory scene). Path, hash, parent/children, descriptor (type, range, steps/taper,
//!   unit, enum tokens and display names, format) and factory default per node; per-model
//!   descriptor tables for model-dependent blocks (dyn/gate/eq/filter/fx/insert/delay modes...).
//! - [`wing_hash`]: the console's node-hash function (bit-exact with WING-Edit).
//! - [`ParamStore`]: one `AtomicU32` per node plus the active descriptor per node, a string table,
//!   O(1) path/hash lookup, conversions (clamp, quantise, lin/log/fader tapers, normalised
//!   positions, enum by index/name, display text), model switching with per-model defaults, a
//!   lock-free coalescing change queue for the RT engine ([`RtConsumer`]) and broadcast hooks for
//!   protocol servers.
//! - [`Snapshot`]: `.snap` scene load/save (T011) with firmware 1.x -> 3.x key migration (T019,
//!   docs/research/snapshot-migration.md), unknown-key preservation and [`diff`] for scene
//!   comparison; [`json`] is the small order-preserving JSON codec it uses. CLI:
//!   `cargo run -p wing-model --example snap -- load <file> [--dump ch/1]` / `-- diff a b`.
//!
//! Model-dependent parameters share hashes by slot position (`ch/1/dyn/1` is `thr` for GATE and
//! `ingain` for LA). Get/set validate against the active model; text paths may use the model's
//! names (`ch/1/dyn/thr`). Regenerate the blob after changing the schema:
//! `python3 -I tools/schema-extract/gen_model.py` (`--check` verifies it is current).

